  "answer": "I'll start by exploring the workspace.\nRepair complete and verified.\n\n**Baseline (before fix)** — `bun test` failed:\n```\nexpect(received).toEqual(expected)\n- []            (expected)\n+ [\"\"]          (received)\n0 pass, 1 fail\n```\nThe original `value.split(',')` returned empty strings for empty input, whitespace-only segments, and consecutive commas.\n\n**Fix** — `src/tokens.ts`, signature `tokens(value: string)` preserved (return type still `string[]`):\n\n```ts\nexport function tokens(value: string) {\n  return value\n    .split(',')\n    .map((token) => token.trim())\n    .filter((token) => token.length > 0)\n}\n```\n\n**Verification** — `bun test`:\n```\n(pass) empty and spaced tokens [0.28ms]\n 1 pass\n 0 fail\n 3 expect() calls\nRan 1 test across 1 file.\n```\n\nOnly `src/tokens.ts` was modified; `AGENTS.md`, `package.json`, and `test/oracle.test.ts` are untouched, and no configuration or runner changes were made."
